### R13 · app/ui/main/dsh/connect.ts:85 · major · CONFIRMED

- **summary**：已建立连接断开后仍把死亡 socket 当作 ready 返回。
- **触发条件**：首次连接成功后 dsh/WebSocket 断线，在退避等待或重新连接期间调用 ready() 或 rpc()。onDead 只安排重连，没有清除 this.socket；ready() 第 104 行因此立即返回旧 socket，而不是等待新的 generation。用注入 socket 重现，触发死亡回调后 ready() 返回的仍是同一旧对象。
- **失败表现**：重连期间的开流请求会直接在死亡 socket 上抛错；rpc() 也绕过就绪等待立即请求暂时不可用的上游，导致本应等待自动恢复的操作失败。这与已列出的首次连接失败不重试不同，发生在已成功连接后的正常断线恢复路径。
- **verifier 证据**：All premises verified in code and reproduced. (1) connect.ts:80-84 — after first successful connect, this.socket holds the live socket. (2) socket.ts:38-39 + 47-53 — an established socket's ws 'error'/'close' fires die(), which fires deadCbs once and leaves the socket permanently dead; nothing prevents normal disconnects. (3) connect.ts:85-87 — the onDead handler only calls scheduleReconnect(); this.socket is never cleared (only reassigned at connect.ts:83 on the next successful connectOnce, closed-but-not-cleared at connect.ts:121; scheduleReconnect at connect.ts:91-100 touches neither). The connect.ts:86 `this.socket === socket` guard only suppresses old-socket-closed-on-upgrade reconnects, it does not protect this path. (4) connect.ts:104 — during the dead window this.socket !== undefined, so ready() resolves immediately with the dead socket; no liveness or generation guard exists anywhere; the repo's own reconnect test (tests/unit/shell/connect.test.ts:71-75) only checks generation eventually increments. (5) Failure occurs: socket.ts:66-67 (via :87) — any open/openStream on the returned socket throws DshMuxSocketError('mux socket is not open'); and connect.ts:111-115 — rpc() bypasses the ready-gate (line 113's undefined guard can't trigger) and fires rpcRaw immediately, whose bare fetch (connect.ts:28) rejects when the outage also affects HTTP, propagating uncaught through production callers with no try/catch (m1-api/index.ts:159, m3-meta/orchestrate.ts:86,105, m3-meta/index.ts:58,82, m3-meta/restore.ts:34). Reproduction (node --experimental-strip-types on unmodified copies of connect.ts/socket.ts in a /dev/shm sandbox with a stub 'ws', repo's own death trigger from connect.test.ts:73, backoffMs=5000): after ws close, ready() returned the SAME dead socket (=== true), generation still 1 (reconnect pending), openStream threw "mux socket is not open". (6) Introduced by this diff: file added entirely by commit 22f806f (U-00) within b634e9d..aa9d934